  "definition": "Explosive",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-04-30",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03 New. #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRED: 1-10-05 New. #8261, eff 1-21-05; ss and moved by #9765-A, eff 8-2-10 (from Saf-C 5002.09); renumbered by #12124 (from Saf-C 5002.11); ss by #12738, eff 4-30-19",
